@startuml service-autonomous-realization-boundary
title Service vs Autonomous Service Realization Boundary
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Service\n<<universal>>" as svc
class "Autonomous Service\n<<specialization>>" as autosvc

svc <|-- autosvc : contextual specialization

note right of svc
  Means through which value
  is made available
  per ADR-ES-002
end note

note right of autosvc
  How the service is realized
  (bounded independence)
  per ADR-ES-015 §3
end note

note bottom of autosvc
  Autonomy qualifies realization
  Does NOT redefine Service
end note
@enduml
